"Služba je poskytována tak, jak je, bez jakékoli záruky. Kterýkoli nástroj "
"můžeme kdykoli změnit, pozastavit nebo ukončit."

#: templates/legal/terms.html:65
msgid "3. Registration and account"
msgstr "3. Registrace a účet"

#: templates/legal/terms.html:67
msgid ""
"Using the application requires registration, during which you provide true "
"and current details. You are responsible for keeping your password secure, "
"for not sharing it with third parties, and for all activity on your account. "
"The operator reserves the right to suspend or cancel an account that "
"seriously breaches these terms, provides false information, or misuses the "
"service."
msgstr ""
