msgstr "se vaří"

#: templates/wip.html:32
msgid ""
"We're currently refining this tool to ensure it meets the Teachka standard "
"of calm, effortless organization."
msgstr ""
"Tento nástroj aktuálně ladíme, aby splňoval standard Teachka: klidnou a "
"snadnou organizaci."

